WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.949
Hi The Face, it’s Pa Salieu

00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.811
We’re in Milan

00:00:05.106 --> 00:00:07.806
Bottega, head to toe

00:00:09.206 --> 00:00:10.560
As you can see

00:00:10.561 --> 00:00:11.920
Looking live, we’re looking fresh

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.180
What was the last text message that you received?

00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:16.579
I received a schedule for my next

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:17.860
Because I’m working on an album right now,

00:00:17.861 --> 00:00:20.920
so, it’s a lot of texts from my manager

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.460
Get ready for France next week

00:00:22.461 --> 00:00:23.174
So, yeah

00:00:23.175 --> 00:00:26.265
If you could describe the album in one word, what would you say?

00:00:26.266 --> 00:00:27.055
Ecstatic
